OL,4,CWorking men's club 'deeply affected'   
OL,5,Cby coach death                         
OL,6,GBosses at a working men's club said    
OL,7,Gthey have been left "deeply affected"  
OL,8,Gafter one if its members was hit by a  
OL,9,Gcoach and killed at a service station  
OL,10,Gin Lancashire.                         
OL,12,FReleasing a statement with more        
OL,13,Fdetail, Thurcroft Miners Institute,    
OL,14,Fbased in Rotherham, Yorkshire, said    
OL,15,Fthe man was standing behind the coach  
OL,16,Fas it was reversing - with its driver  
OL,17,Fbelieving all passengers had alighted. 
OL,19,FPolice were called to the incident at  
OL,20,FRivington services near Chorley at     
OL,21,F14:30 GMT on Sunday, when the victim   
OL,22,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene. G2/4 
