OL,4,CJames Nelson-Joyce hits back at        
OL,5,Cmayor's TV drama criticism             
OL,6,GThis City Is Ours actor James Nelson-  
OL,7,GJoyce said he is "proud" of the        
OL,8,GLiverpool-based show and has defended  
OL,9,Git following criticism from the city   
OL,10,Gregion's mayor.                        
OL,12,FEarlier this month Steve Rotheram said 
OL,13,Fhe would like TV dramas set in his     
OL,14,Fhome city to focus on the "warmth" of  
OL,15,Fthe people, rather than "drugs,        
OL,16,Forganised crime and criminal activity".
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
