OL,4,CChemical Brothers to headline Kendal   
OL,5,CCalling                                
OL,6,GThe Chemical Brothers and Blossoms     
OL,7,Ghave been announced as headliners for  
OL,8,GKendal Calling 2027.                   
OL,10,FThe remaining headline acts for the    
OL,11,Ffour-day festival at Lowther Deer      
OL,12,FPark, in Cumbria, have also been       
OL,13,Frevealed as Black Eyed Peas and Jamie  
OL,14,FT.                                     
OL,16,FThe festival will take place from      
OL,17,FThursday 29 July until Sunday 1 August 
OL,18,Fand will feature more than 100 acts,   
OL,19,Fincluding musicians and comedians.     
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
